  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iyemero (Ekiti) Agbelowo Farmers Cassava Proccessing Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Iyemero (Ekiti) Agbelowo Farmers Business School Cooperative Multipurpose Society is proposing to establish a farmers business school that would serve as a training centre for members on improved farming methods and that provides members with improved seedlings and training on cassava processing. The group would like to invest grants fund in building the capacity of its members as well as making agricultural inputs and small-scale equipment available to members. The group will invest part of the fund to construct a cassava processing plant. The group anticipates that 2000 youth and women will be trained and supported to boost production and household income.</narrative>
  </description>
